    {
      "title": "Срок: ttl при входе и refreshSession",
      "text": "У сессии два срока: длина, выданная при входе (`ttl`, по умолчанию 7 дней), и текущий конец. Телефон Анны входит на 2 часа — `ttl: '2h'` (число — секунды, строка — `'15m'`, `'2h'`, `'7 days'`). `refreshSession({ ttl })` сдвигает конец на «сейчас + ttl», но не дальше длины, выданной при входе, и никогда не укорачивает: семь дней телефону не продлить. Ответ — новый срок строкой ISO; здесь он пересчитан в часы. Непонятный `ttl` — `invalid_data`.",
      "code": "phone = await db.open({ ...annaKey, ttl: '2h' });\nreturn {\n  'телефон: refreshSession 7 дней, часов': hoursLeft(await phone.refreshSession({ ttl: '7 days' })),\n  'Анна: refreshSession(), часов': hoursLeft(await me.refreshSession()),\n  'Анна: refreshSession 1 час, часов': hoursLeft(await me.refreshSession({ ttl: '1h' })),\n  \"ttl: 'вечно'\": await db.open({ ...annaKey, ttl: 'вечно' }).then(() => 'вошла', (e) => e.code),\n};",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">phone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">annaKey, ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'телефон: refreshSession 7 дней, часов'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hoursLeft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phone.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refreshSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'Анна: refreshSession(), часов'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hoursLeft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refreshSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'Анна: refreshSession 1 час, часов'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hoursLeft</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refreshSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"ttl: 'вечно'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">annaKey, ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'вечно'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'вошла'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre>",
